  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "CoAP: Add support for more Content-Formats",
  "description": "This MR adds support for additional CoAP Content-Formats registered with IANA (see [here](https://www.iana.org/assignments/core-parameters/core-parameters.xhtml#table-content-formats)).\n\nMost additions should be trivial. However, I was a bit wondering how to best format the two `application/json` and `application/cbor` variations with Content Coding `deflate`. In the current state of the MR, I put the Content Coding values in parentheses. Let me know if you have a better suggestion :)",
